{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RATSHOT\u00a0is\u00a0a slick, fast paced platformer where you use the recoil of your gun to launch yourself through levels. Race through grimy streets and sewers while trying to get the best times and ranks, or play at your own pace and admire the graffiti-covered walls of NYC.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/2aac67ea4f5838d844cb8f700898fcd5.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/2aac67ea4f5838d844cb8f700898fcd5.webm?t=1767242492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/2aac67ea4f5838d844cb8f700898fcd5.mp4?t=1767242492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/437d248da8a360d65e9dcebcba09a7ce.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/437d248da8a360d65e9dcebcba09a7ce.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RATSHOT is a game that encourages ballistic speeds, and it rewards you for gaining a grasp on Gutter's chaotic moveset. Levels are quite short, and many can be beaten in less that a minute. Don't be fooled though, each level is packed with lots to do such as stealing wallets, completing dares, and going for the legendary <strong>P rank!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/ad00b9be53e25099a3d0a8145f6c69a2.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/ad00b9be53e25099a3d0a8145f6c69a2.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RATSHOT, as you can probably see, has a rough sketchy artstyle reminiscent of games on Newgrounds and graffiti. Speaking of graffiti, this game has a lot of it! If you stop to look around levels, you'll see lots of street art and graffiti tags. Maybe you'll even be able to paint some of your own...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/a308af17d76c0363ddc2b7185d3fd63f.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/a308af17d76c0363ddc2b7185d3fd63f.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, this game has a lot of rats... I'm not sure if that's a selling point for you or not lmao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can follow my YouTube channel (button on the right) to follow development on the game or join the Discord to be notified when the Steam demo comes out. The Steam demo is coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give the game a wishlist! Worst case scenario someone sees it on your wishlist and gives you a free game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/703097b2a4101ef89b2e05e20bb1fc63.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/703097b2a4101ef89b2e05e20bb1fc63.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980250?t=1767242492","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/0dce3de0529cb3367e10e3c9661fdc33dfc04a13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767242492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/869578729f8d659d00fa331de578ec859f3b673e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767242492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/869578729f8d659d00fa331de578ec859f3b673e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767242492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RATSHOT\u00a0is\u00a0a slick, fast paced platformer where you use the recoil of your gun to launch yourself through levels. Race through grimy streets and sewers while trying to get the best times and ranks, or play at your own pace and admire the graffiti-covered walls of NYC.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/2aac67ea4f5838d844cb8f700898fcd5.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/2aac67ea4f5838d844cb8f700898fcd5.webm?t=1767242492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/2aac67ea4f5838d844cb8f700898fcd5.mp4?t=1767242492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/437d248da8a360d65e9dcebcba09a7ce.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/437d248da8a360d65e9dcebcba09a7ce.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RATSHOT is a game that encourages ballistic speeds, and it rewards you for gaining a grasp on Gutter's chaotic moveset. Levels are quite short, and many can be beaten in less that a minute. Don't be fooled though, each level is packed with lots to do such as stealing wallets, completing dares, and going for the legendary <strong>P rank!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/ad00b9be53e25099a3d0a8145f6c69a2.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/ad00b9be53e25099a3d0a8145f6c69a2.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RATSHOT, as you can probably see, has a rough sketchy artstyle reminiscent of games on Newgrounds and graffiti. Speaking of graffiti, this game has a lot of it! If you stop to look around levels, you'll see lots of street art and graffiti tags. Maybe you'll even be able to paint some of your own...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/a308af17d76c0363ddc2b7185d3fd63f.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/a308af17d76c0363ddc2b7185d3fd63f.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, this game has a lot of rats... I'm not sure if that's a selling point for you or not lmao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can follow my YouTube channel (button on the right) to follow development on the game or join the Discord to be notified when the Steam demo comes out. The Steam demo is coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give the game a wishlist! Worst case scenario someone sees it on your wishlist and gives you a free game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/703097b2a4101ef89b2e05e20bb1fc63.gif?t=1767242492\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/extras/703097b2a4101ef89b2e05e20bb1fc63.poster.avif?t=1767242492\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RetroCrow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980250/b68cb8b60952e1354eba02f0d4ebf2db0b33f1b8/header.jpg?t=1767242492","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"RATSHOT","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Mace Face Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0"